      "message": "fix: show live StoreKit prices and expiry on カロナビ+\n\nThe purchase screen reads the localized price from StoreKit, states the\nbilling period and how to cancel, and links to the in-app terms and\nprivacy pages. Plus access follows the subscription expiry. First-time\nfree-limit and paid-conversion counts store only a user id, event type,\nand a server timestamp.\n\nCo-authored-by: naruto-aii <naruto-aii@users.noreply.github.com>",
